<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amerigas downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amerigas downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said Monday it had lowered its rating on the shares of Amerigas Partners LP to maintain from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/8 to 25-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk))</p>
</text>
